Observed first pilot run (before the local audit script was fixed): AssertionError at measure.py source-span digest check. The pilot script had sliced seven characters from raw_span_sha256 even when that field was an unprefixed hex digest. The actual original error appeared in this task's tool output; the source and peer rule were not modified. The final script uses removeprefix('sha256:') and pilot.log records a passing full ten-company impact run.
